---
layout: base.njk
---

<main class="pt-32 pb-20">
      <!-- Hero Section -->
      <section class="px-8 md:px-20 mb-24">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
          <h1
            class="serif-tight text-6xl md:text-8xl text-primary mb-6 leading-none"
          >
            Inmersión <br /><span class="italic font-light">en el Paisaje</span>
          </h1>
          <p
            class="font-body text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed"
          >
            Un recorrido visual por la arquitectura contemporánea fusionada con
            la nobleza de la piedra local y maderas nativas en el corazón de La
            Serena.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <!-- Section: Exteriores (Bento Grid Style) -->
      <section class="mb-32">
        <div class="px-8 md:px-20 mb-12 flex justify-between items-end">
          <div>
            <span
              class="font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-outline mb-2 block"
              >Capítulo I</span
            >
            <h2 class="serif-tight text-4xl text-on-surface">Exterior</h2>
          </div>
          <p
            class="font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant hidden md:block italic"
          >
            Integración orgánica con el terreno
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 px-4 md:px-8">
          <!-- Large Main Image -->
          <div
            class="md:col-span-8 h-[600px] bg-surface-container-low overflow-hidden relative group"
          >
            <img
              class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale-[20%] group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
              data-alt="Modern house architecture in La Serena landscape"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDY5651c90aqJVQwFnnsXLQdx6UoBo3IWPcyLo8lOJSh_oBRMMCNtsOVcfwuEDQRmJ1oXeOA34r0CVGT6IsfwkcR2I71ySlTUSKernRkOj6GRScqMV-zXByvC6jnKrXOdNr-_nvCz7Ssi9T2qJvQJ9eIN_oB3SkCbxWlvbIzYGLwlb9GiwBa17Gvi2dgCQ9vQm0ALwRPB096AL-CGvfFi6ahfI3fzmQ2NWlJUqaNCI2h84JztICH_2zlSwXeRyDZ6K3tWfmTnT6-Lk"
            />
            <div class="absolute bottom-10 left-10 glass-overlay p-6 max-w-xs">
              <span
                class="font-label text-xs font-bold text-primary block mb-2 uppercase"
                >Vista Norte</span
              >
              <p class="font-body text-sm text-on-surface">
                La estructura se eleva sutilmente sobre el nivel del suelo para
                preservar la flora nativa.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Vertical Detail -->
          <div class="md:col-span-4 h-[600px] flex flex-col gap-6">
            <div class="h-1/2 bg-surface-container overflow-hidden">
              <img
                class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale-[10%]"
                data-alt="Detail of pool reflecting coastal sky"
                src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBZZkDUFOopTcjgqNX7_gzXk79EtqQWqhZcfasvbUMUAj9NxuR_0E7s80dTat0fhSDu7NcnPLKSLkmESYvX72SbMmQl2xuZtv5Nu5o-xZwfxQ1uCm154epB9dJQkd3-u2s_3TlvPvPMQa3BrmmMR0LoDG1g6EqNlBOLTpqcQebUQja_Q25Bn0EGZ5s0PRKnvmbUwbOFOPqYPIHtdH_kM4ZKNWrSEFj1lRLNfqJSt0z5iE4hWTwsPZC4BvFJuYN9_XfZMKHK4fTprIw"
              />
            </div>
            <div
              class="h-1/2 bg-surface-container overflow-hidden p-12 flex flex-col justify-center border-l border-outline-variant/20"
            >
              <h3 class="serif-tight text-3xl mb-4 italic text-secondary">
                Luz &amp; Sombra
              </h3>
              <p
                class="font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant"
              >
                Los aleros extendidos protegen de la radiación directa mientras
                crean un juego rítmico de sombras sobre los muros de piedra.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <!-- Section: Interiores (Editorial Asymmetric) -->
      <section class="bg-surface-container-low py-32 mb-32">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-20 items-center">
            <div class="order-2 md:order-1 relative">
              <div
                class="aspect-[4/5] bg-surface-container-highest overflow-hidden"
              >
                <img
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                  data-alt="Minimalist living room with floor to ceiling windows"
                  src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBnxOgBzS2iTbaX-tK1DFVwp7EiXJj_rD7aRb6Z4-WydOnIDD17PzFfnC7ROpPnsjvyBxH_V5VUe2E2p4i5CDIjD99MmG-pZLX9NVOz5uQ6laSy4TEg7nySuFdS8UC5LQBKHtIJrQNLz6Rdo01L0E0ZNREf_4dBvmKL7yYrXChlbV-MfyB2SkNsL00ZvPiShe8KadqsyzptbpF1zSCWvcz1NyE2h151ST3itn1drqH0VLUJeTy1az6lol63GNpHc9gXyjBugIQAi4k"
                />
              </div>
              <!-- Floating Detail Image -->
              <div
                class="absolute -bottom-12 -right-12 w-64 h-80 hidden md:block bg-surface p-2 shadow-2xl"
              >
                <img
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                  data-alt="Kitchen detail with natural wood finishes"
                  src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuB6eLWyGMg5Ii6blUqxN7tGi9kOw1VnGm07LU29B375lSo9w6hT_VpQ0mBrKiusAbnlvBT41_zZ640y3VojtiqTK0lWonz3bL01jygJg92ycZeE6CDH4Ia-L2ck3Sy59U-VnU4PC4PsbGMEC1zVcIF1wdE4V2V7CzAnrjkM5tkL0S_CiDFaa7gZhSRW8jOsPr5bmYRsN7XcrlQ188TVWi2050H-1TC6jUgAfSDw-Gx3Qu05EfhWgQiCxcC7dKyhUu69lDN2LRU4gXo"
                />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="order-1 md:order-2 md:pl-10">
              <span
                class="font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-outline mb-4 block"
                >Capítulo II</span
              >
              <h2 class="serif-tight text-5xl text-on-surface mb-8">
                Interiores
              </h2>
              <div class="space-y-6 font-body text-on-surface-variant text-lg">
                <p>
                  Espacios diáfanos que eliminan la barrera entre el adentro y
                  el afuera. El uso de ventanales de piso a cielo permite que el
                  paisaje de La Serena sea el cuadro principal de cada
                  habitación.
                </p>
                <p
                  class="text-sm font-label uppercase tracking-widest text-primary pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/30 inline-block"
                >
                  Materiales: Roble, Hormigón Visto, Lino
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <!-- Section: Detalles (Materiality Grid) -->
      <section class="px-8 md:px-20 mb-32">
        <div class="text-center mb-20">
          <span
            class="font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-outline mb-2 block"
            >Capítulo III</span
          >
          <h2 class="serif-tight text-4xl text-on-surface">
            Detalles &amp; Materialidad
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-8">
          <div class="aspect-square bg-surface-container overflow-hidden group">
            <img
              class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500"
              data-alt="Close up of rough stone texture"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDnM0xQXhm2meoaIe8oauONAQvdMD3YPx3D4bxx28LhdMnGziPps60l-C6-AdtxNSGEAxmjrA9J1hxxwzEmr76gDVXqt3EfK1o0neYEj2mdWeVw_w-Coa6cXRNLlI4zEKhuoFQXf2hRdAP7JqJKCZrEjKXsOZct04WiRsQTtYlHmE64xGqVkTipx4gvj6WO5Z-03giV_QwinSz3f-8hHJ704MPjD07gDCw8CPA8_sYmK7GoyrVP2jncjT_FJLjla81noliUoYOwElU"
            />
            <div
              class="p-4 bg-surface-container-low text-[10px] font-label uppercase tracking-widest"
            >
              Piedra de Cantera Local
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="aspect-square bg-surface-container overflow-hidden group pt-12 md:pt-24"
          >
            <img
              class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500"
              data-alt="Detail of wooden joint architecture"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCOVtAsPvp5bFMb4CpWZJ5Br0pmf7eoZReSRG4nYlVUZmj6LuyY6EVANOcKJV6JNsxaduYkL7k21JcLHUTqLBoO3DNJReYUMRzgTues5iMuPdKXBt-TsPFryuUD33-gM4QjvQxrncrNVyCDOl-9spbjkmf9BkP2LxZgV8I2SyVSdUhsfw28Jk-bU3qEjKZi-yycjn2hPbqLgWwsu8CE42FgVujdGDKGXpSNZZXO-uPHY7pYOyLK0gFAU4WbYy6rR4owb5xfK9f9ClA"
            />
            <div
              class="p-4 bg-surface-container-low text-[10px] font-label uppercase tracking-widest"
            >
              Carpintería en Roble
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="aspect-square bg-surface-container overflow-hidden group">
            <img
              class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500"
              data-alt="Brushed concrete floor texture"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAaWp8HBOpnyDcSmYKRCWfLttIEOsy_VT4Uh4jyBh2Ek-v_pVQin6tNjvEs7KlLoZHDzLcEkd7Qe9Y1wCg5TbsL-Ijo0V80N4-t2_kBPooHMyczIMgTvxXNaO6YTfvV6IHZDX2jusprNDP10ok2ymaSQbNuDq7i20yXVi7HfrW-3ORxv3vPg4UdCiG6J20isLVy1yHfvLJfAKAPF05W9mfNtySvkDuw31ZL3kJVm-gz_9v074L_c9sMBEEaAgmVUmBqRXH7byoq4v0"
            />
            <div
              class="p-4 bg-surface-container-low text-[10px] font-label uppercase tracking-widest"
            >
              Hormigón Pulido
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="aspect-square bg-surface-container overflow-hidden group pt-12 md:pt-24"
          >
            <img
              class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500"
              data-alt="Natural linen fabric texture"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDi9T59J38uGcyCthvrdRxjpyb-Y646-8HQXOze6X0KbwSO9UhTM7vrnR_bQiSeBrfOzAscqfYPS9TWd1KPcxXXh1ui_KAfSDu1k1VudN-h1H6l4WgmKRXlXvqkYJAoMjkKR2gcLTxfmdBKQrhaUhulNMZ-VmovFEaSObr96pFwbd1VPzLp5pdfQJwU6-rUHN1vW5Mg02hL328MIkQHpLfIQV3e-PfAX2d3d1xvsP_jt8kIl5qlSHtaEuEJ0w_oC1hcr56ecKjbAXg"
            />
            <div
              class="p-4 bg-surface-container-low text-[10px] font-label uppercase tracking-widest"
            >
              Textiles de Lino Crudo
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <!-- Full Bleed Immersive Section -->
      <section
        class="w-full h-[819px] relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center"
      >
        <img
          class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
          data-alt="Full bleed view of the house at sunset"
          src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDtjUluFFDqu4QQkD4VxpCytcJIVNSw9AKLvUkDwRTsU3KO1m9u__7YL1gu8mlv0JE4qItWXoRE666WkH9W1WqR6Oxg_bub38GZycnGzr1K6ch-Zsty2W8o9u_ClWAXogDS43b10LSdP3Jr8boHSzeVzytGvQ3pCBcQJZAJsKZW4o4GKm-EuwmU20-O1UeYFj4U24mCay2Lq4nSLLDP6cjGqOakKhrAXAu7s6uQ7KbSHShNiaBgu-qRlAc0usr7oQMK1eeTjlaer98"
        />
        <div
          class="relative z-10 p-12 md:p-20 glass-overlay max-w-2xl text-center mx-4"
        >
          <h2 class="serif-tight text-4xl md:text-5xl text-primary mb-6">
            ¿Listo para vivir la experiencia?
          </h2>
          <p class="font-body text-on-surface-variant mb-8">
            Coordina una visita privada para conocer cada rincón de esta obra
            arquitectónica.
          </p>
          <button
            class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-10 py-4 rounded-lg font-label text-sm uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-primary-container transition-colors shadow-xl"
          >
            Agendar ahora
          </button>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
